    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:df_18_30.
_:df_18_29 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class> <https://schema.org/Organization>.
_:df_18_30 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:df_18_31;
    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil>.
