    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Eindig de Creative Commons-licentie-URI met een slash"@nl, "End the Creative Commons license URI with a slash"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <https://def.nde.nl/dataset#LicenseCreativeCommonsTrailingSlashShape>.
<https://def.nde.nl/dataset#LicenseCreativeCommonsTrailingSlashShape> a <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#or> _:df_18_227.
