    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:df_18_99.
_:df_18_97 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:df_18_98.
_:df_18_98 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://schema.org/encodingFormat>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1.
_:df_18_99 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:df_18_100;
    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil>.
_:df_18_100 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:df_18_101.
_:df_18_101 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://schema.org/usageInfo>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1.
_:df_18_102 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "De URL die rechtstreeks toegang biedt tot de distributie zelf: het databestand of het endpoint van de web-API.\n                Gebruik `schema:documentation` als er daarnaast een documentatiepagina is die de distributie beschrijft of ontsluit (zoals een SPARQL-UI of een downloadlandingspagina)."@nl, "The URL that provides direct access to the distribution itself: the data file or the web API endpoint.\n                Use `schema:documentation` if there is also a documentation page that describes or provides access to the distribution (such as a SPARQL UI or a download landing page)."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://schema.org/contentUrl>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Voeg de URL toe waar de distributie rechtstreeks toegankelijk is"@nl, "Add the URL where the distribution can be directly accessed"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1.
_:df_18_103 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#IRI>;
    <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_104;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://schema.org/contentUrl>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik een waarde van type URI (RDF-resource), geen tekst"@nl, "Use a value of type URI (RDF resource), not text"@en.
_:df_18_104 <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_105 <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_106;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://schema.org/contentUrl>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik een geldige HTTPS-URL voor de distributie"@nl, "Use a valid HTTPS URL for the distribution"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^https://".
_:df_18_106 <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_107 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Het mediatype van het downloadbare bestand. Gebruik een waarde uit de IANA media types-lijst. De waarde geeft het mediatype aan van de response van schema:contentUrl wanneer er geen Accept-header wordt meegestuurd. Bij gecomprimeerde distributies moet het compressieformaat (bijv. zip, gzip) worden toegevoegd (bijv. text/turtle+gzip)."@nl, "The media type of the downloadable file. Use a value from the IANA media types list. The value should indicate the media type of the response of schema:contentUrl when no Accept header is included in the request. When the distribution is compressed, the compression format (such as `zip`, `gzip`) must be included (such as `text/turtle+gzip`)."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://schema.org/encodingFormat>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Vul een geldig MIME-type in, bijv. application/n-triples"@nl, "Enter a valid MIME type, such as application/n-triples"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^[a-zA-Z]+/[a-zA-Z0-9][a-zA-Z0-9!#$&\\-^_.+]*$".
_:df_18_108 <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_109;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://schema.org/encodingFormat>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik maximaal één MIME-type per distributie"@nl, "Use at most one MIME type per distribution"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1.
_:df_18_109 <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_110 <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_112;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://schema.org/encodingFormat>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Verwijder het SPARQL MIME-type uit schema:encodingFormat; SPARQL-endpoints worden gedeclareerd via schema:usageInfo"@nl, "Remove the SPARQL MIME type from schema:encodingFormat; SPARQL endpoints are declared via schema:usageInfo"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#not> _:df_18_111.
_:df_18_111 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "application/sparql-".
_:df_18_112 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "geen SPARQL-mediatype"@nl, "no SPARQL media type"@en;
    <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_113 <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_119;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://schema.org/encodingFormat>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Een kaal compressietype (zoals application/zip of application/gzip) geeft niet aan welk mediatype de ingepakte bestanden hebben. Declareer het werkelijke mediatype met een compressiesuffix, bijvoorbeeld application/rdf+xml+zip of text/csv+gzip"@nl, "A bare compression type (such as application/zip or application/gzip) does not indicate the media type of the packaged file(s). Declare the actual media type with a compression suffix, such as application/rdf+xml+zip or text/csv+gzip"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#not> _:df_18_114.
_:df_18_115 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> "application/zip";
    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:df_18_116.
_:df_18_116 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> "application/x-zip-compressed";
    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:df_18_117.
_:df_18_117 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> "application/gzip";
    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:df_18_118.
_:df_18_118 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> "application/x-gzip";
    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil>.
_:df_18_114 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#in> _:df_18_115.
_:df_18_119 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "geen kaal compressietype"@nl, "no bare compression type"@en;
    <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_120 <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_122;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://schema.org/encodingFormat>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik een geregistreerd IANA-mediatype. Mediatypes met het voorvoegsel x- (zoals application/x-zip-compressed) zijn niet geregistreerd bij IANA; gebruik het geregistreerde type, bijvoorbeeld application/zip"@nl, "Use a registered IANA media type. Media types with the x- prefix (such as application/x-zip-compressed) are not registered with IANA; use the registered type, such as application/zip"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#not> _:df_18_121.
_:df_18_121 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^[a-zA-Z]+/x-".
_:df_18_122 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "geen x-mediatype"@nl, "no x- media type"@en;
    <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_123 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Beschrijving van de distributie"@nl, "Distribution description"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://schema.org/description>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#or> _:df_18_124;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik een waarde van type xsd:string of rdf:langString"@nl, "Use a value of type xsd:string or rdf:langString"@en.
_:df_18_124 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:df_18_125;
    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:df_18_126.
_:df_18_125 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string>.
_:df_18_126 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:df_18_127;
    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil>.
_:df_18_127 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString>.
_:df_18_128 <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_129;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://schema.org/description>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik per taal maximaal één waarde"@nl, "Use at most one value per language"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#uniqueLang> true.
_:df_18_129 <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_130 a <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "De datum van formele uitgifte (bijvoorbeeld publicatie) van de distributie."@nl, "The date of formal issuance (such as publication) of the distribution."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://schema.org/datePublished>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 0;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1.
_:df_18_131 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "De meest recente datum waarop de distributie is gewijzigd of aangepast."@nl, "The most recent date on which the distribution was changed or modified."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://schema.org/dateModified>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 0;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1.
_:df_18_132 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Taal of talen waarin de distributie beschikbaar is. Gebruik een BCP 47-taalcode, bijv. `nl`."@nl, "Language or languages in which the distribution is available. Use a BCP 47 language code, such as `nl`."@en;
    <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_133;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://schema.org/inLanguage>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 0;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik een BCP 47-taalcode, bijv. nl of en"@nl, "Use a BCP 47 language code, such as nl or en"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^[a-zA-Z]{2,3}(-[a-zA-Z0-9]+)*$".
_:df_18_133 <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^[a-zA-Z]{2,3}(-[a-zA-Z0-9]+)*$".
_:df_18_134 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Licentie die van toepassing is op deze distributie en die de licentie van de bovenliggende dataset overschrijft. Optioneel; gebruik dit alleen wanneer de distributie een andere licentie heeft dan de dataset."@nl, "License applicable to this distribution, overriding the parent dataset's license. Optional; only set this when the distribution carries a different license from the dataset."@en;
