_:df_18_199 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Het type identificatie, bijvoorbeeld KvK of ISIL."@nl, "The type of identifier, such as Chamber of Commerce (KvK) or ISIL."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://schema.org/propertyID>.
