_:df_18_318 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "De datum waarop de dataset is aangemaakt."@nl, "The date on which the dataset was created."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Info>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Vul de aanmaakdatum in"@nl, "Enter the creation date"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1.
_:df_18_319 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "De datum van formele uitgifte (bijvoorbeeld publicatie) van de dataset."@nl, "The date of formal issuance (such as publication) of the dataset."@en;
