    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1.
_:df_18_320 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "De meest recente datum waarop de dataset is gewijzigd of aangepast."@nl, "The most recent date on which the dataset was changed or modified."@en;
