    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:df_18_340.
_:df_18_339 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person>.
_:df_18_340 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:df_18_341;
    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil>.
_:df_18_341 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent>.
_:df_18_342 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik maximaal één uitgever"@nl, "Use at most one publisher"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1.
_:df_18_343 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "De organisatie of persoon die verantwoordelijk is voor het creëren van de beschreven dataset."@nl, "An entity (organisation or person) responsible for producing the dataset."@en;
    <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_344;
