_:df_18_382 <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_384;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#mediaType>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Verwijder het SPARQL MIME-type uit dcat:mediaType; SPARQL-endpoints worden gedeclareerd via dct:conformsTo"@nl, "Remove the SPARQL MIME type from dcat:mediaType; SPARQL endpoints are declared via dct:conformsTo"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#not> _:df_18_383.
_:df_18_383 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "application/sparql-".
_:df_18_384 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "geen SPARQL-mediatype"@nl, "no SPARQL media type"@en;
    <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_385 <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_386;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#mediaType>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik maximaal één mediatype per distributie"@nl, "Use at most one media type per distribution"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1.
_:df_18_386 <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_387 <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_389;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#mediaType>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik een geregistreerd IANA-mediatype. Mediatypes met het voorvoegsel x- (zoals application/x-zip-compressed) zijn niet geregistreerd bij IANA; gebruik het geregistreerde type, bijvoorbeeld application/zip"@nl, "Use a registered IANA media type. Media types with the x- prefix (such as application/x-zip-compressed) are not registered with IANA; use the registered type, such as application/zip"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#not> _:df_18_388.
_:df_18_388 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^(https?://www\\.iana\\.org/assignments/media-types/)?[a-zA-Z]+/x-".
_:df_18_389 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "geen x-mediatype"@nl, "no x- media type"@en;
    <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_390 <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_392;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#mediaType>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Geef het compressietype (zoals application/zip of application/gzip) op in dcat:compressFormat, en het mediatype van de ingepakte bestanden in dcat:mediaType"@nl, "Give the compression type (such as application/zip or application/gzip) in dcat:compressFormat, and the media type of the packed file(s) in dcat:mediaType"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#not> _:df_18_391.
_:df_18_391 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^(https?://www\\.iana\\.org/assignments/media-types/)?application/(zip|gzip|x-gzip|x-zip-compressed)$";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#flags> "i".
_:df_18_392 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "geen compressietype (gebruik dcat:compressFormat)"@nl, "no compression type (use dcat:compressFormat)"@en;
    <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_393 <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_395;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#mediaType>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Verplaats het compressieachtervoegsel naar dcat:compressFormat: gebruik bijvoorbeeld dcat:mediaType text/turtle met dcat:compressFormat application/gzip in plaats van text/turtle+gzip"@nl, "Move the compression suffix to dcat:compressFormat: for example, use dcat:mediaType text/turtle with dcat:compressFormat application/gzip rather than text/turtle+gzip"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#not> _:df_18_394.
_:df_18_394 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "\\+(zip|gzip)$";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#flags> "i".
_:df_18_395 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "geen compressieachtervoegsel (gebruik dcat:compressFormat)"@nl, "no compression suffix (use dcat:compressFormat)"@en;
    <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_396 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "De URL die toegang verschaft tot een distributie van de dataset."@nl, "The URL that provides access to a distribution of the dataset."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL>.
_:df_18_397 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "De URL van het downloadbare bestand in een bepaald formaat."@nl, "The URL of the downloadable file in a specific format."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL>.
_:df_18_398 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Het compressieformaat van de distributie, als mediatype uit de IANA media types-lijst (bijv. `application/gzip`). Geef compressie in DCAT hier aan, niet in `dcat:mediaType`: een kaal compressietype (bijv. `application/zip`) of een achtervoegsel (bijv. `text/turtle+gzip`) daar geeft een waarschuwing. Zijn beide opgegeven, dan heeft `dcat:compressFormat` voorrang. Een waarde die geen mediatype is (bijv. `gzip` in plaats van `application/gzip`) wordt niet opgenomen."@nl, "The compression format of the distribution, as a media type from the IANA media types list (such as `application/gzip`). In DCAT, declare compression here, not in `dcat:mediaType`: a bare compression type (such as `application/zip`) or a suffix (such as `text/turtle+gzip`) there gives a warning. If both are given, `dcat:compressFormat` takes precedence. A value that is not a media type (such as `gzip` rather than `application/gzip`) is not recorded."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#compressFormat>.
_:df_18_399 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Standaarden of specificaties waaraan de distributie voldoet. Voor SPARQL-endpoints moet dit de SPARQL protocol-URI bevatten."@nl, "Standards or specifications the distribution conforms to. For SPARQL endpoints, this must include the SPARQL protocol URI."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/conformsTo>.
_:df_18_400 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#IRI>;
    <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_401;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/conformsTo>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik een waarde van type URI (RDF-resource), geen tekst"@nl, "Use a value of type URI (RDF resource), not text"@en.
_:df_18_401 <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_402 <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_403;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/conformsTo>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Use a web URI starting with http:// or https://"@en, "Gebruik een web URI die begint met http:// of https://"@nl;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^https?://".
_:df_18_403 <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_404 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "De naam van de distributie."@nl, "The name of the distribution."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title>.
_:df_18_405 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Beschrijving van de distributie"@nl, "Distribution description"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#or> _:df_18_406;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik een waarde van type xsd:string of rdf:langString"@nl, "Use a value of type xsd:string or rdf:langString"@en.
_:df_18_406 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:df_18_407;
    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:df_18_408.
_:df_18_407 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string>.
_:df_18_408 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:df_18_409;
    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil>.
_:df_18_409 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString>.
_:df_18_410 <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_411;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik per taal maximaal één waarde"@nl, "Use at most one value per language"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#uniqueLang> true.
_:df_18_411 <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_412 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Info>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Voeg een beschrijving toe"@nl, "Add a description"@en.
_:df_18_413 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "De datum van formele uitgifte (bijvoorbeeld publicatie) van de distributie."@nl, "The date of formal issuance (such as publication) of the distribution."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik maximaal één uitgiftedatum"@nl, "Use at most one issue date"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1.
_:df_18_414 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "De meest recente datum waarop de distributie is gewijzigd of aangepast."@nl, "The most recent date on which the distribution was changed or modified."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik maximaal één wijzigingsdatum"@nl, "Use at most one modification date"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1.
_:df_18_415 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Bestandsgrootte van de distributie in bytes."@nl, "Distribution file size in bytes."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#byteSize>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik maximaal één bestandsgrootte"@nl, "Use at most one file size"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1.
_:df_18_416 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Een documentatiepagina die deze distributie beschrijft of ontsluit, zoals een SPARQL-UI of een downloadlandingspagina.\n            `dcat:accessURL` en `dcat:downloadURL` wijzen naar de distributie zelf (het API-endpoint of het databestand)."@nl, "A documentation page that describes or provides access to this distribution, such as a SPARQL UI or a download landing page.\n            `dcat:accessURL` and `dcat:downloadURL` point to the distribution itself (the API endpoint or the data file)."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/page>.
_:df_18_417 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "De licentie waaronder de distributie beschikbaar is gesteld."@nl, "The license under which the distribution is made available."@en;
    <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_418;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 1;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Voeg één licentie toe"@nl, "Add exactly one license"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> 1.
_:df_18_418 <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_419 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#IRI>;
    <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_420;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik een waarde van type URI (RDF-resource), geen tekst"@nl, "Use a value of type URI (RDF resource), not text"@en.
_:df_18_420 <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_421 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Eindig de Creative Commons-licentie-URL met een slash"@nl, "End the Creative Commons license URL with a slash"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <https://def.nde.nl/dataset#LicenseCreativeCommonsTrailingSlashShape>.
_:df_18_422 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik de Creative Commons-URL zelf, geen opendefinition.org-alias"@nl, "Use the Creative Commons URL directly, not an opendefinition.org alias"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <https://def.nde.nl/dataset#LicenseNotOpenDefinitionShape>.
_:df_18_423 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik de officiële Open Data Commons-licentie-URL met versienummer, bijv. http://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1.0/"@nl, "Use an official Open Data Commons licence URL with a version number, such as http://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1.0/"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <https://def.nde.nl/dataset#LicenseOpenDataCommonsShape>.
_:df_18_424 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "De natuurlijke taal van de tekstuele waarden in de distributie. Gebruik een waarde uit de <a href=\"https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/concept-scheme/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language\">EU Vocabularies Languages Named Authority List</a>."@nl, "The natural language of the textual values in the distribution. Use a value from the <a href=\"https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/concept-scheme/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language\">EU Vocabularies Languages Named Authority List</a>."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> 0;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Info>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Vul de taal of talen in waarin de distributie beschikbaar is"@nl, "Enter the language or languages of the distribution"@en.
_:df_18_425 <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_426;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik een web-URL die begint met https://"@nl, "Use a web URL starting with https://"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^https://".
_:df_18_426 <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_427 <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_428;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik een web-URL die begint met https://"@nl, "Use a web URL starting with https://"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^https://".
_:df_18_428 <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_429 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#IRI>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/page>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik een waarde van type URI (RDF-resource), geen tekst"@nl, "Use a value of type URI (RDF resource), not text"@en.
_:df_18_430 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/page>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik een web-URL die begint met https://"@nl, "Use a web URL starting with https://"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^https://".
_:df_18_431 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#IRI>;
    <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_432;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik een waarde van type URI (RDF-resource), geen tekst"@nl, "Use a value of type URI (RDF resource), not text"@en.
_:df_18_432 <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_433 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#IRI>;
    <https://def.nde.nl#futureChange> _:df_18_434;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Gebruik een waarde van type URI (RDF-resource), geen tekst"@nl, "Use a value of type URI (RDF resource), not text"@en.
_:df_18_434 <https://def.nde.nl#version> "2.0";
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation>.
_:df_18_435 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "De accessURL is niet bereikbaar; de dataset kan niet worden geraadpleegd."@nl, "The accessURL is not reachable; the dataset cannot be accessed."@en;
    <https://def.nde.nl/probe#probeReachable> true.
_:df_18_436 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#downloadURL>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "De downloadURL is niet bereikbaar; het bestand kan niet worden opgehaald."@nl, "The downloadURL is not reachable; the file cannot be retrieved."@en;
    <https://def.nde.nl/probe#probeReachable> true.
_:df_18_437 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#accessURL>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Het Content-Type van de accessURL komt niet overeen met de opgegeven dcat:mediaType."@nl, "The Content-Type of the accessURL does not match the declared dcat:mediaType."@en;
